  (text "12V system. Input protection + 5V buck + 3.3V LDO + switched 12V rail.  '+12V' = protected rail (post Q1); '+12V_HLD' is the diode-isolated hold-up node that rides out crank dips."
    (at 20 18 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 1bbad7e9-e2e9-418e-9340-e02a6661fdeb)
  )
  (text "+12V_SW feeds ONLY the K1-K6 coils (6 x 33mA) and D+ excitation (100mA) = 300mA. Field loads are fed from J8 pin 1 by the installer, so no field current crosses this board."
    (at 40 235 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid a57ae757-4890-4b29-a1ec-9102f2be7974)
  )

